  "description": "Find the minimum number of operations to connect all computers given an initial network configuration.",
  "target": 1,
  "pseudocode": "1. if (connections.length < n - 1) return -1;\n2. parent = Array(n).fill().map((_, i) => i);\n3. count = n;\n4. for (let [u, v] of connections) {\n5.   if (find(u) !== find(v)) {\n6.     union(u, v);\n7.     count--;\n8.   }\n9. }\n10. return count - 1;",
